1, 95mm ultra-short barrel body, small and portable;
2, 25m/s super wind speed, fast dry;
3, double needle 100 million level self-circulating negative ions, double needle collaborative hair care, neutralizing static electricity, smoothing frizz;
4, 57℃ intelligent constant temperature, 60 times per second temperature detection, prevent overheating injury;
5, multiple overheating protection, careful safety care;
6, double anti-hot air nozzle, safe and fast shaping;

Press the mode key to switch three levels of air temperature:
Natural windshield: output natural cold air, suitable for hair styling;
57℃ constant temperature stop: ideal dry temperature, prevent overheating injury;
Hot air speed dry block: suitable for quickly drying wet hair;

1, when cleaning, please make sure that the power switch is off and unplug the power plug;
2, please use a towel, cotton swab or toothbrush to remove the attachment of the inlet and outlet regularly;
3. Do not use nails or sharp objects to press or rub the inlet and outlet to avoid damaging the product;
4, do not use alcohol, nail polish remover or detergent to clean this product, otherwise it may cause failure, breakage or fading.

1, L10 has a 95mm ultra-short barrel body, when blowing hair, if the hair is too close to the air inlet, the hair is easy to inhale the hair dryer, please ensure that the hair and the air inlet to maintain more than 10cm distance;
2, when the hair dryer is used, the temperature of the outlet will increase, please ensure that the hair is kept more than 3cm away from the outlet to avoid hair burns.
3. When using the hair dryer, pay attention to avoid blocking the outlet and inlet, otherwise the hair dryer will enter the thermal protection state, enter the overheat protection state, and need to stand for 5 minutes before restarting.

There are two things that can cause hot hair to redness:
1, abnormal use, such as towels, clothes to block the tuyere or the hair dryer into the shoe, and other forms of blocking the hair dryer, this situation needs to cut off the power supply and wait for a few minutes, to ensure that the inlet and outlet are not blocked before starting to use, if it still appears, apply for after-sales;
2. If the hair dryer itself fails, apply for after-sales service.
